{"reachable": false, "rationale": "Blocking containerHost:execution makes tokenCache:credentialAccess unreachable, since containerHost is its only parent. That in turn blocks apiToken:authenticate and ssoLogin:authenticate (both AND steps need tokenCache) and jumpHost:lateralMovement. Blocking mailClient:execution makes the AND steps rdpLogin:authenticate and vpnSession:authenticate unreachable. Because vpnSession is down, monitoringHost:lateralMovement is unreachable. Because rdpLogin is down, hypervisor:privilegeEscalation and secretsManager:privilegeEscalation are unreachable. Because both vpnSession and browserStore are down, fileServer:lateralMovement is unreachable. Because ssoLogin is down, localAdmin:privilegeEscalation and serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation are unreachable. printServer:lateralMovement is unreachable because tokenCache, vpnSession and apiToken are all unreachable. Each parent of crownData:exfiltrate is therefore cut off: codeRepo:collection (fileServer, localAdmin and hypervisor all down), mailArchive:collection (printServer down), shareMount:collection (serviceAccount and secretsManager down) and dbReplica:collection (monitoringHost and hypervisor down). The target is not reachable."}
```

